# Local development defaults (loaded automatically by `next dev`).
#
# V1 frontend is fully static: it reads public/radar-static/radar.json at build
# time and makes no runtime network calls. No backend, no proxy, no API key.
# No environment variables are required.
#
# Refresh the compiled data from the repository root with `radar build`, or use
# `radar demo-build` to compile the clearly-labelled sample fixtures.
